[1m[38;5;231mWhich approach should the spec be built around?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: ES module tracker (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mtracker.js with real imports, capped localStorage queue, flush seam. Requires serving the directory; native modules
[39m     [38;5;246mdon't load over file://.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: window global tracker
     [38;5;246mSame queue and record shape, loaded as a classic script attaching window.Tracker. No serving requirement, but a [39m
     [38;5;246mglobal plus load-order dependency.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C: declarative auto-tracking
